/*
  TelemetryErrorsWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0100 · TelemetryErrorsWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TelemetryErrorsWidget` resolves (table "TelemetryErrorsWidget") lives here
  with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
